{"book":"kinney","chapter":"tailwind","chapterTitle":"Tailwind CSS","slug":"flexbox-initial-size","title":"الحجم الأولي","headings":[{"depth":2,"id":"القيم-الشائعة","text":"القيم الشائعة"},{"depth":2,"id":"مقياس-التباعد","text":"مقياس التباعد"},{"depth":2,"id":"اختصار-flex","text":"اختصار flex"},{"depth":2,"id":"أنماط-شائعة","text":"أنماط شائعة"}],"html":"<p>اضبط الحجم الأولي لعناصر flex قبل نموها أو انكماشها باستخدام أدوات <code>basis-*</code>.</p>\n<h2 id=\"القيم-الشائعة\">القيم الشائعة</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><code>basis-auto</code> - الحجم بناءً على المحتوى</li>\n<li><code>basis-0</code> - البدء من عرض صفر</li>\n<li><code>basis-full</code> - 100% من الحاوية</li>\n<li><code>basis-1/2</code> - 50% من الحاوية</li>\n<li><code>basis-1/3</code> - 33.333% من الحاوية</li>\n<li><code>basis-2/3</code> - 66.667% من الحاوية</li>\n<li><code>basis-1/4</code> - 25% من الحاوية</li>\n<li><code>basis-3/4</code> - 75% من الحاوية</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"مقياس-التباعد\">مقياس التباعد</h2>\n<p>استخدم قيمًا رقمية من مقياس التباعد:</p>\n<ul>\n<li><code>basis-4</code> - 1rem</li>\n<li><code>basis-8</code> - 2rem</li>\n<li><code>basis-16</code> - 4rem</li>\n<li><code>basis-32</code> - 8rem</li>\n<li><code>basis-64</code> - 16rem</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"اختصار-flex\">اختصار flex</h2>\n<p>ادمج grow وshrink وbasis مع أدوات flex:</p>\n<ul>\n<li><code>flex-1</code> - <code>flex: 1 1 0%</code> (ينمو وينكمش من 0)</li>\n<li><code>flex-auto</code> - <code>flex: 1 1 auto</code> (ينمو وينكمش من حجم المحتوى)</li>\n<li><code>flex-initial</code> - <code>flex: 0 1 auto</code> (انكماش فقط)</li>\n<li><code>flex-none</code> - <code>flex: 0 0 auto</code> (حجم ثابت)</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"أنماط-شائعة\">أنماط شائعة</h2>\n<p><em>أنماط شائعة — المثال 1 — <a href=\"https://stevekinney.com/generated/playgrounds/85a4f7a8e89ee6cd9da297b8fbf6123f413ef4f3cd44b68b798a98da623db032.html\">افتح المثال</a></em></p>\n<pre><code class=\"language-html\"><span class=\"hljs-comment\">&lt;!-- Three equal columns --&gt;</span>\n<span class=\"hljs-tag\">&lt;<span class=\"hljs-name\">div</span> <span class=\"hljs-attr\">class</span>=<span class=\"hljs-string\">&quot;flex gap-4 rounded-lg bg-gray-100 p-4&quot;</span>&gt;</span>\n  <span class=\"hljs-tag\">&lt;<span class=\"hljs-name\">div</span> <span class=\"hljs-attr\">class</span>=<span class=\"hljs-string\">&quot;flex-1 basis-0 rounded bg-blue-500 p-4 text-center text-white&quot;</span>&gt;</span>Column 1<span class=\"hljs-tag\">&lt;/<span class=\"hljs-name\">div</span>&gt;</span>\n  <span class=\"hljs-tag\">&lt;<span class=\"hljs-name\">div</span> <span class=\"hljs-attr\">class</span>=<span class=\"hljs-string\">&quot;flex-1 basis-0 rounded bg-green-500 p-4 text-center text-white&quot;</span>&gt;</span>Column 2<span class=\"hljs-tag\">&lt;/<span class=\"hljs-name\">div</span>&gt;</span>\n  <span class=\"hljs-tag\">&lt;<span class=\"hljs-name\">div</span> <span class=\"hljs-attr\">class</span>=<span class=\"hljs-string\">&quot;flex-1 basis-0 rounded bg-purple-500 p-4 text-center text-white&quot;</span>&gt;</span>Column 3<span class=\"hljs-tag\">&lt;/<span class=\"hljs-name\">div</span>&gt;</span>\n<span class=\"hljs-tag\">&lt;/<span class=\"hljs-name\">div</span>&gt;</span>\n\n<span class=\"hljs-comment\">&lt;!-- Sidebar with flexible content --&gt;</span>\n<span class=\"hljs-tag\">&lt;<span class=\"hljs-name\">div</span> <span class=\"hljs-attr\">class</span>=<span class=\"hljs-string\">&quot;flex min-h-[200px] gap-4 rounded-lg bg-gray-100 p-4&quot;</span>&gt;</span>\n  <span class=\"hljs-tag\">&lt;<span class=\"hljs-name\">aside</span> <span class=\"hljs-attr\">class</span>=<span class=\"hljs-string\">&quot;basis-64 rounded bg-gray-700 p-4 text-white&quot;</span>&gt;</span>\n    <span class=\"hljs-tag\">&lt;<span class=\"hljs-name\">h3</span> <span class=\"hljs-attr\">class</span>=<span class=\"hljs-string\">&quot;mb-2 font-bold&quot;</span>&gt;</span>Fixed sidebar<span class=\"hljs-tag\">&lt;/<span class=\"hljs-name\">h3</span>&gt;</span>\n    <span class=\"hljs-tag\">&lt;<span class=\"hljs-name\">p</span> <span class=\"hljs-attr\">class</span>=<span class=\"hljs-string\">&quot;text-sm&quot;</span>&gt;</span>Width: 16rem (256px)<span class=\"hljs-tag\">&lt;/<span class=\"hljs-name\">p</span>&gt;</span>\n  <span class=\"hljs-tag\">&lt;/<span class=\"hljs-name\">aside</span>&gt;</span>\n  <span class=\"hljs-tag\">&lt;<span class=\"hljs-name\">main</span> <span class=\"hljs-attr\">class</span>=<span class=\"hljs-string\">&quot;flex-1 rounded bg-white p-4 shadow&quot;</span>&gt;</span>\n    <span class=\"hljs-tag\">&lt;<span class=\"hljs-name\">h2</span> <span class=\"hljs-attr\">class</span>=<span class=\"hljs-string\">&quot;mb-2 font-bold&quot;</span>&gt;</span>Flexible content<span class=\"hljs-tag\">&lt;/<span class=\"hljs-name\">h2</span>&gt;</span>\n    <span class=\"hljs-tag\">&lt;<span class=\"hljs-name\">p</span> <span class=\"hljs-attr\">class</span>=<span class=\"hljs-string\">&quot;text-gray-700&quot;</span>&gt;</span>This area expands to fill remaining space<span class=\"hljs-tag\">&lt;/<span class=\"hljs-name\">p</span>&gt;</span>\n  <span class=\"hljs-tag\">&lt;/<span class=\"hljs-name\">main</span>&gt;</span>\n<span class=\"hljs-tag\">&lt;/<span class=\"hljs-name\">div</span>&gt;</span>\n\n<span class=\"hljs-comment\">&lt;!-- Responsive columns --&gt;</span>\n<span class=\"hljs-tag\">&lt;<span class=\"hljs-name\">div</span> <span class=\"hljs-attr\">class</span>=<span class=\"hljs-string\">&quot;flex flex-wrap gap-4 rounded-lg bg-gray-100 p-4&quot;</span>&gt;</span>\n  <span class=\"hljs-tag\">&lt;<span class=\"hljs-name\">div</span> <span class=\"hljs-attr\">class</span>=<span class=\"hljs-string\">&quot;basis-full rounded bg-orange-500 p-4 text-white md:basis-1/2 lg:basis-1/3&quot;</span>&gt;</span>\n    <span class=\"hljs-tag\">&lt;<span class=\"hljs-name\">h3</span> <span class=\"hljs-attr\">class</span>=<span class=\"hljs-string\">&quot;font-bold&quot;</span>&gt;</span>Responsive Item 1<span class=\"hljs-tag\">&lt;/<span class=\"hljs-name\">h3</span>&gt;</span>\n    <span class=\"hljs-tag\">&lt;<span class=\"hljs-name\">p</span> <span class=\"hljs-attr\">class</span>=<span class=\"hljs-string\">&quot;text-sm&quot;</span>&gt;</span>Full width on mobile, half on tablet, third on desktop<span class=\"hljs-tag\">&lt;/<span class=\"hljs-name\">p</span>&gt;</span>\n  <span class=\"hljs-tag\">&lt;/<span class=\"hljs-name\">div</span>&gt;</span>\n  <span class=\"hljs-tag\">&lt;<span class=\"hljs-name\">div</span> <span class=\"hljs-attr\">class</span>=<span class=\"hljs-string\">&quot;basis-full rounded bg-pink-500 p-4 text-white md:basis-1/2 lg:basis-1/3&quot;</span>&gt;</span>\n    <span class=\"hljs-tag\">&lt;<span class=\"hljs-name\">h3</span> <span class=\"hljs-attr\">class</span>=<span class=\"hljs-string\">&quot;font-bold&quot;</span>&gt;</span>Responsive Item 2<span class=\"hljs-tag\">&lt;/<span class=\"hljs-name\">h3</span>&gt;</span>\n    <span class=\"hljs-tag\">&lt;<span class=\"hljs-name\">p</span> <span class=\"hljs-attr\">class</span>=<span class=\"hljs-string\">&quot;text-sm&quot;</span>&gt;</span>Full width on mobile, half on tablet, third on desktop<span class=\"hljs-tag\">&lt;/<span class=\"hljs-name\">p</span>&gt;</span>\n  <span class=\"hljs-tag\">&lt;/<span class=\"hljs-name\">div</span>&gt;</span>\n  <span class=\"hljs-tag\">&lt;<span class=\"hljs-name\">div</span> <span class=\"hljs-attr\">class</span>=<span class=\"hljs-string\">&quot;basis-full rounded bg-indigo-500 p-4 text-white md:basis-1/2 lg:basis-1/3&quot;</span>&gt;</span>\n    <span class=\"hljs-tag\">&lt;<span class=\"hljs-name\">h3</span> <span class=\"hljs-attr\">class</span>=<span class=\"hljs-string\">&quot;font-bold&quot;</span>&gt;</span>Responsive Item 3<span class=\"hljs-tag\">&lt;/<span class=\"hljs-name\">h3</span>&gt;</span>\n    <span class=\"hljs-tag\">&lt;<span class=\"hljs-name\">p</span> <span class=\"hljs-attr\">class</span>=<span class=\"hljs-string\">&quot;text-sm&quot;</span>&gt;</span>Full width on mobile, half on tablet, third on desktop<span class=\"hljs-tag\">&lt;/<span class=\"hljs-name\">p</span>&gt;</span>\n  <span class=\"hljs-tag\">&lt;/<span class=\"hljs-name\">div</span>&gt;</span>\n<span class=\"hljs-tag\">&lt;/<span class=\"hljs-name\">div</span>&gt;</span>\n</code></pre>\n"}